Style + rendering:

- Clean bold ink linework with minimal crosshatching (keep lines thick enough for 64px readability)
- Limited flat shading (2–3 values max), avoid painterly texture
- Common grey glow: very subtle neutral rim-light/halo in pale grey around the shield edge (tight, controlled, no big bloom)
- Palette: iron greys + dark charcoal shadows + pale grey highlights; keep it subdued (no saturated colors)

Details to include (kept simple):

- A couple of rivets or rim studs (2–4 max)
- Uneven wear on the edge (small dents), but keep the silhouette clean
- Stamp mark centered on the boss (geometric crest shape, not text)

Constraints:

Transparent background, no circle frame unless your icon set uses one. No text, no watermark, no logo, no background effects.')
