Style + rendering:

- Clean ink linework with sparse crosshatching (keep lines bold enough for 64px readability)
- Limited flat shading (2–3 values max), avoid painterly texture
- Epic purple/violet rim-glow: tight, controlled glow halo around the shield edge and along the rift crack (no big soft bloom); include a few small violet sparks/motes
- Palette: dark steel/iron greys + deep indigo shadows + electric violet highlights (purple glow is the main accent)

Constraints:

- Transparent background (no circle frame unless your icon set uses one)
- No text, no watermark, no logo
- No busy background effects; keep negative space around the silhouette for UI readability')
