INSERT INTO public.sprite_assets (asset_key, category, tier, unity_path, target_w, target_h, frame_count, ppu, filter_mode, primary_color, prompt_template) VALUES ('gear_rift_tempered_lance', 'gear', 'icon', 'Sprites/Icons/Gear/gear_rift_tempered_lance', 64, 64, 1, 16, 'Point', 'purple', 'dark fantasy RPG item icon, flat illustration, transparent background, readable at 64px. Bold ink linework, minimal crosshatching, high silhouette clarity. No text, no watermark, no UI frame.

**Asset:** `gear_rift_tempered_lance`  

**Tier:** Rift-tempered (use your Rift gear treatment) — **void-violet rift glow**, controlled and crisp.

**Subject:** Rift-tempered lance — long, disciplined cavalry/guard lance with a brutal, reinforced spearhead.

- Head: elongated leaf/diamond spear tip with a **tempered, layered metal look** (2–3 flat values only).
- Core feature: a **single rift-tempering seam** running up the center of the spearhead (like a heat-treated weld line), cracked slightly in 1–2 places to imply void stress.
- Optional: small side hooks / short barbs near the base of the head (one per side, minimal) for “anti-armor” utility—keep silhouette clean.

**Rift-tempered material cues (make it feel forged for the Rift):**

- Metal is dark void-steel with a subtle “tempered” gradient implied via **hard value steps** (not smooth gradients): near-black shadow → gunmetal mid → sharp edge highlight.
- Add 2–4 tiny stress-rune notches along the seam (purely abstract marks, not readable text).

**Rift glow (tight, no bloom):**

- Glow originates **only from the center seam + micro-cracks** (not the whole outline).
- 1–2px stepped aura: deep violet core → brighter violet → tiny pale lavender edge highlight.
- 3–6 tiny violet motes drifting off the seam near the tip (sparse, readable).

**Shaft / grip:**

- Shaft: dark wood or blackened metal pole; show only enough to read “lance” at icon scale.
- Add a single reinforcing wrap band below the head (2–3 rivets max) to sell durability/engineering.

**Composition + constraints:**

- Centered, diagonal orientation (tip up-right) to maximize silhouette and show the spearhead seam.
- Flat illustration (no painterly texture), no gradients/blur, transparent background, clean edges, **no alpha bleed**, no scenery/props.')
ON CONFLICT (asset_key) DO UPDATE SET
  category = EXCLUDED.category, tier = EXCLUDED.tier, unity_path = EXCLUDED.unity_path,
  target_w = EXCLUDED.target_w, target_h = EXCLUDED.target_h, frame_count = EXCLUDED.frame_count,
  ppu = EXCLUDED.ppu, filter_mode = EXCLUDED.filter_mode,
  primary_color = COALESCE(EXCLUDED.primary_color, public.sprite_assets.primary_color),
  prompt_template = EXCLUDED.prompt_template;

INSERT INTO public.sprite_assets (asset_key, category, tier, unity_path, target_w, target_h, frame_count, ppu, filter_mode, primary_color, prompt_template) VALUES ('gear_riftdiver_blade', 'gear', 'icon', 'Sprites/Icons/Gear/gear_riftdiver_blade', 64, 64, 1, 16, 'Point', 'green', 'Dark fantasy RPG item icon, flat illustration, transparent background, readable at 64px, ink linework, centered composition, high silhouette clarity. Uncommon tier (green glow). Subject: longsword with worn cross-guard — crusader aesthetic, prayer-worn hilt.

Key design details:

- Blade: straight longsword blade with a simple fuller; slightly nicked edge and dulled finish (subtle wear, not broken)
- Cross-guard: worn, slightly asymmetrical quillons (or subtly downturned “crusader” guard), with scuffs and small chips
- Hilt: leather-wrapped grip polished smooth by prayer use; small prayer beads wrapped around the grip or dangling from the pommel (minimal, readable)
- Pommel: simple disc or scent-stopper pommel; optional tiny holy mark etched into pommel cap (abstract shape, not readable text)

Glow / uncommon treatment:

- Tight controlled green rim-glow hugging the sword silhouette (2-band max: deep forest green outer + bright jade/emerald inner highlight)
- Concentrate glow subtly around the hilt/guard and pommel (suggest “blessed”), keep the blade mostly non-glowing
- Optional: 2–3 tiny emerald motes near the guard only (sparse)

Style constraints:

- Bold ink linework with minimal crosshatching (stay readable at 64px)
- Limited flat shading (2–3 values max), avoid painterly rendering
- Transparent background, no frame unless your icon set uses one
- No readable text, no watermark, no logos')
ON CONFLICT (asset_key) DO UPDATE SET
  category = EXCLUDED.category, tier = EXCLUDED.tier, unity_path = EXCLUDED.unity_path,
  target_w = EXCLUDED.target_w, target_h = EXCLUDED.target_h, frame_count = EXCLUDED.frame_count,
  ppu = EXCLUDED.ppu, filter_mode = EXCLUDED.filter_mode,
  primary_color = COALESCE(EXCLUDED.primary_color, public.sprite_assets.primary_color),
  prompt_template = EXCLUDED.prompt_template;

INSERT INTO public.sprite_assets (asset_key, category, tier, unity_path, target_w, target_h, frame_count, ppu, filter_mode, primary_color, prompt_template) VALUES ('gear_serratedknife_charter', 'gear', 'icon', 'Sprites/Icons/Gear/gear_serratedknife_charter', 64, 64, 1, 16, 'Point', 'green', 'dark fantasy RPG item icon, flat illustration, transparent background, readable at 64px. Bold ink linework, minimal crosshatching, high silhouette clarity. No text, no watermark, no UI frame.

**Asset:** `gear_serratedknife_charter`  

**Tier:** Charter (uncommon) — **uncommon green glow**, controlled and crisp.

**Subject:** Precision-serrated combat knife (short blade) — engineered, regulated “charter smith” work.  

- Blade profile: narrow, straight-to-slightly-tapered with a sharp point (utility + thrusting).
- Edge: **fine, evenly spaced serrations** along the cutting edge (clean rhythm, not chipped damage).
- Spine: reinforced and straight; add a small squared ricasso for “manufactured” clarity.
- Hilt: minimalist guard + sturdy handle with a wrapped grip and a simple pommel cap (no gems).

**Charter-grade forging cues (make it feel issued, not ornate):**

- One reinforced collar/bolster at the base of the blade with **2–3 rivets max**.
- A single small stamped charter mark near the ricasso (abstract symbol only; not readable text).
- Materials: dark iron/void-steel with **2–3 value shading**; minimal wear/nicks (keep clean).

**Uncommon green glow (tight, no bloom):**

- Glow should **hug the serration highlights + collar seam** only (not a full outline).
- 1–2px stepped aura: deep green core → lighter green edge highlight (avoid neon lime).
