Subject: Massive curved reaper blade (scythe-like) with an exaggerated crescent profile; heavy, brutal “execution” weight. The blade spine is split by a jagged void crack running most of the length (like fractured obsidian), with a few tiny rift splinters breaking outward (kept minimal and readable).

