- Palette: deep violet core + 1–2 stepped lighter purples (no soft airbrush bloom)
- Glow should hug the crack and a few select inner spine points only (1–2 px aura), not a full outer outline
- Add 2–4 tiny purple motes near the crack to sell “HP harvest” (keep sparse)

Theme cue (“harvests HP”) without clutter:

- Optional: a single small droplet/teardrop-shaped essence gem hanging near the inner curve (abstract), lit by the purple crack glow
- Avoid gore; if any “life drain” hint appears, keep it as abstract energy wisps, not blood

Style constraints:

- Flat illustration with ink linework, limited shading, no gradients, no blur
- Centered composition, fills most of the 64x64 canvas with padding for readability
- Transparent background, clean edges (no alpha bleed), no extra props or scenery')
