**Subject:** “Compass Axis” symbol representing the two-allegiance / two-axis system (Crown ↔ Void).  

- Core shape: a **crosshair / axis cross** (vertical + horizontal) with a small **center dot**.
- Tips: subtle **arrowhead nubs** on the four ends (1–2px each) to read “axis,” not “plus sign.”
- Optional: a tiny **half-crown notch** on the top tip and a tiny **rift notch** on the bottom tip (abstract, 1–2px, not detailed) to hint Crown vs Void without becoming a full emblem.

**Palette / style constraints (match your compass set):**

- **1px near-black outline** `#0C0C14`
- **Three clear contrast tiers** (light / mid / shadow), desaturated grey base
- Hard pixel edges, **no anti-aliasing**, **no blur**, **zero alpha bleed**
- Minimal internal detail (no texture noise, no gradients)

**Coloring suggestion (safe default):**

- Mid grey fill for the axis arms
- Lighter grey highlight on the top-left edges
- Near-black shadow on bottom-right edges
- Keep any faction hint extremely subtle (no glow unless this icon is meant to glow)

**Negative prompts:**

No text, no watermark, no UI frame, no background, no decorative flourishes, no complex runes.')
