- Accent: **electric violet** highlights on the crack edges (tight, stepped)
- Optional warning tint: 1–2 pixels of **crimson** only if your corruption system uses a red-violet “danger” cue (keep extremely limited)

**Rendering constraints:**

- **Hard pixel edges**, **no anti-aliasing**, **no blur**, **zero alpha bleed**
