INSERT INTO public.sprite_assets (asset_key, category, tier, unity_path, target_w, target_h, frame_count, ppu, filter_mode, primary_color, prompt_template) VALUES ('relic_golden_parachute', 'relic', 'icon', 'Sprites/Icons/Relics/relic_golden_parachute', 64, 64, 1, 16, 'Point', '#32C882', 'Dark fantasy Void Ledger relic icon, corrupted accounting artifact, jade (#32C882) and void palette, transparent background, readable at 64px, flat illustration with ink linework, centered composition, high silhouette clarity. Subject: a golden parachute deploying from an armor backplate — “escape velocity” implied (rapid upward pull).

Composition:

- Backplate: cropped upper-torso armor backplate silhouette (just enough to read “armor”), dark void-steel with a few plate seams and rivets (minimal, not ornate)
- Deployment: a compact golden parachute canopy popping out from a back-mounted housing/slot at the top of the backplate
- Lines: 3–5 thick, simplified suspension lines tethering to the backplate mount (avoid hair-thin lines)
- Motion cue: 2–3 sharp trailing streaks or angled “speed lines” behind/under the backplate, plus a slight upward tilt of the canopy to suggest acceleration

Palette / lighting:

- Gold parachute: pale gold highlight + warm gold midtone + deep amber shadow (3 clear tiers)
- Void armor: near-black / deep purple-black base with restrained cool highlights
- Corruption accent: jade #32C882 as a thin rim highlight on the deployment housing and 2–4 small motes trailing upward (sparingly)
- Glow: tight, controlled jade rim-glow hugging select edges (no big bloom), and a faint void-violet shadow aura behind the armor silhouette for separation

Style constraints:

- Bold ink linework with minimal crosshatching (stays readable at 64px)
- Limited flat shading (2–3 values per material), avoid painterly texture
- Transparent background
- No readable text, no watermark, no logos')
