Design:

- Envelope: simple angular silhouette, slightly opened at the top with a folded flap; a wax seal dot or clasp (tiny) near center
- Map fragment: torn paper corner sticking out, showing abstract node-map lines (simple branching lines + 2–3 dots), NOT readable text
- Void influence: a dark void tear stain creeping from one corner of the envelope, with a faint rift edge glow

Palette + rendering:

- Envelope paper: muted off-white/grey with dark shadow folds
- Map: slightly warmer parchment tone, darker ink lines
- Void glow: dark purple-black base with a tight, subtle violet rim-glow along the rift stain edge (pixel-stepped only; 1–2 px halo, no blur)
- 1px near-black outline (#0C0C14), hard pixel edges, no anti-aliasing, zero alpha bleed
- Three clear contrast tiers; minimal internal detail (avoid noise)

Negative prompts: no background, no UI frame, no letters, no readable writing, no watermark, no soft gradients, no neon.')
