- Flat fill: dark grey or muted steel-grey interior (single tone), with optional 1px inner highlight along the top edge of the shin plate for readability
- Keep generous negative space around the boot so it reads on busy UI

Negative prompts: no text, no watermark, no background, no ornate engraving, no glow effects.')
