INSERT INTO public.sprite_assets (asset_key, category, tier, unity_path, target_w, target_h, frame_count, ppu, filter_mode, primary_color, prompt_template) VALUES ('portrait_audit_golem_d', 'character', 'portrait', 'Sprites/Portraits/Classes/portrait_audit_golem_d', 48, 64, 1, 32, 'Point', NULL, 'Dark fantasy RPG mercenary portrait, bust shot, gritty low-fantasy realism, ink illustration style, dramatic rim lighting, restrained palette, no text, no watermark. Subject: Awakened Audit Golem (most self-aware variant) — small construct with a cracked chassis, void energy leaking through hairline fractures.

Composition:

- Tight bust framing (head, shoulders, upper torso), centered
- Pose: still and “present” (stamp arms lowered but steady, or lightly clasped), conveying conscious restraint rather than aggression
- Background: simple dark neutral gradient with soft vignette, no scenery clutter

Design details:

- Chassis: dark iron / soot-black plates with many fine hairline fractures across shoulders and chest; cracks are subtle but numerous, like stressed ceramic/iron glaze
- Void leakage: deep violet-black energy seeping through the fractures as thin luminous threads (tight glow, no big bloom), with 2–4 tiny motes escaping near the largest crack
- Face: blank face plate; primary numeral display is faint and “official” (dim segmented digits behind a narrow slit)
- Second numeral layer: a deeper set of numerals/glow visible behind the first layer (like a ghost display under the surface), slightly offset and softer, suggesting layered cognition; numerals must look like digits/segments but remain non-readable/abstract
- Optional: a single thin receipt ribbon or torn receipt strip near the neck/shoulder as a “remnant of function” (microprint-like marks, non-legible)

Lighting / color:

- Dramatic rim lighting: cool steel rim on one side to separate silhouette; faint violet rim on the opposite side reflecting the void leakage
- Palette: near-black iron + deep shadows; accents only in soft violet/indigo void light (and minimal jade only if you want a trace of “ledger” identity)
- Keep highlights controlled and gritty (no glossy sci-fi shine)

Negative prompts: no readable text or numbers, no logos, no heavy bloom, no neon cyan, no busy particle fog, no cartoon proportions.')
