INSERT INTO public.sprite_assets (asset_key, category, tier, unity_path, target_w, target_h, frame_count, ppu, filter_mode, primary_color, prompt_template) VALUES ('portrait_cleric', 'character', 'portrait', 'Sprites/Portraits/portrait_cleric', 48, 64, 1, 32, 'Point', NULL, 'Dark fantasy RPG mercenary portrait, bust shot, gritty low-fantasy realism, ink illustration style, dramatic rim lighting, restrained palette, no text, no watermark. Armored support (cleric/paladin-adjacent) — medium build, determined expression.

Character + pose:

- Bust framing (head, shoulders, upper torso), centered; slight 3/4 turn for depth
- Determined, steady gaze; composed resolve (not shouting)
- Mace at side: visible along the lower edge of frame (haft and head partially in view), worn iron, practical

Armor + identifiers:

- Moderate-to-heavy support armor: mail underlayer with a simple tabard or brigandine plates; practical, low-ornament
- Holy symbol on chest: a clear emblem plate/pendant at sternum (simple geometric cross/sunburst/teardrop icon—no letters), slightly catching light as a focal marker
- Prayer beads: wrapped around one wrist or hanging from belt/collar area, a few beads visible (kept minimal, readable)

Materials + realism:

- Worn cloth tabard with rough stitching, scuffed leather straps, dulled steel edges
- Subtle grime and travel wear (restrained; avoid “too clean”)

Lighting/background:

- Dramatic rim lighting (cool rim) to separate silhouette; faint warm candlelight fill (optional) for a devotional tone
- Background: simple dark neutral gradient with soft vignette, no scenery clutter

Negative prompts: no modern armor, no shiny high-fantasy polish, no giant glowing spell circles, no readable text, no logos, no watermark.')
