Design: dark iron L-shaped corner bracket with compass-rose or cartographic flourish detail. Weathered bronze rivet at corner joint. Subtle etched map-grid lines radiating from corner. Designed for TOP-LEFT anchor — mirror in Unity for other corners.

Rendering: hard pixel edges, no anti-aliasing, no blur. 1px near-black (#0C0C14) outline. 3-value shading (highlight/mid/shadow). NO baked lighting gradients, NO center texture. Asset is a discrete ornament layered over a flat hex-colored container.

Palette: gunmetal iron frame, tarnished bronze rivet accent, muted amber cartographic lines.

Negative: no text, no full box, no 9-slice, no gradients, no blur, no anti-aliasing, no modern elements.')
