Design: narrow vertically-tileable iron rail with evenly spaced rivet dots. Clean repeating pattern for seamless vertical tiling. Designed to run along left/right edges of map info panel between corner ornaments.

Rendering: hard pixel edges, no anti-aliasing. Perfectly tileable top-to-bottom with no seam artifacts. 1px outline. Simple 3-value shading.

