Design: A narrow 8px wide vertical strip that tiles seamlessly when repeated vertically. Simple repeating pattern: iron riveted strip with a rivet every 16px. The top and bottom edges must match perfectly for seamless vertical tiling.
Rendering: Pixel art, 8x32px. Hard edges, 2-value shading. Top row must be pixel-identical to bottom row for seamless tiling.
Palette: Dark iron (#3A3A4A), single rivet highlight in dull brass (#6B5A3A), near-black outline on left and right edges only.
Negative: No ornate detail, no glow, no gradient, no non-repeating elements.')
