Effect: Stun stars orbiting above a unit (overlay VFX) — 3–4 chunky five-point spark stars circling in a tight ring near the top-center of the frame (leave lower half relatively empty so it can sit above the character). Color: bright yellow stars with a small warm amber highlight and near-black shadow pixels for contrast; optional 1px white specular on one star only (keep minimal). Motion across frames is a simple orbit:

1) Frame 1: stars at positions A (e.g., top-left, top-right, mid-top)

2) Frame 2: rotate ~120° clockwise; one star slightly squashes (1px) to imply twinkle

3) Frame 3: rotate ~120° clockwise again; twinkle shifts to a different star

Keep the orbit readable (no particle noise), and ensure stars don’t touch the frame edges. Negative prompts: no smoke, no gradients, no glow bloom, no lightning bolts, no background elements beyond the VFX.')
